Recommends: libegl1, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers
Description: GPU-rendered Notepad++ workalike
 Neko++ is a text editor that reproduces Notepad++'s feature set on Linux:
 multi-document tabs, syntax highlighting for the languages Notepad++ ships,
 find and replace with regular expressions, find in files, bookmarks, macros,
 a function list, a folder-as-workspace panel, user-defined languages, and a
 WebAssembly plugin host.
 .
 It renders through wgpu, so it runs on Vulkan, on OpenGL, or on a software
 rasteriser when neither is available.
